# Local dev scratch and CI download residue. Probe runs under windows/.tmp/
# write real app data (.dek, identity-v1.bin, history-v2.db) into these
# directories, so they must never be stageable.
windows/.tmp/
windows/ci-artifacts/
ci-downloads/

# Runtime logs
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*tailsync-process-audit*.log
